  "notes": "{継続|けいぞく} means continuing or sustaining something over time.\n\nFamous proverb:\n- {継続|けいぞく}は{力|ちから}なり (Persistence is power / Continuity is strength)\n\nCommon collocations:\n- {継続|けいぞく}する (to continue)\n- {継続|けいぞく}{的|てき}（な/に）(continuous(ly))\n- {契約|けいやく}を{継続|けいぞく}する (to continue a contract)\n- {継続|けいぞく}{課金|かきん} (recurring billing, subscription)\n- {継続|けいぞく}{利用|りよう} (continued use)\n\nRelated terms:\n- {続|つづ}ける (to continue - verb)\n- {持続|じぞく} (maintenance, continuation)\n- {連続|れんぞく} (continuation, series)",
